{"id":"0cd12b341f6289c0","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-slice-category.md","title":"切片范畴","display":"df-slice-category — 切片范畴","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-slice-category","display":"df-slice-category — 切片范畴","depends_on":["[[16-df-category]]","[[16-df-functor]]","[[16-df-fibration]]"],"source":"Example 1.3.1; Lemma 5.2.4, pp. 323–324 (PDF 343–344)","revision_date":"2026-10-16","aliases":["16-df-slice-category"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-slice-category"},{"key":"display","html":"df-slice-category — 切片范畴"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c9801f31ec8ac53f\" href=\"?note=c9801f31ec8ac53f\" title=\"16-df-fibration\">16-df-fibration</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Example 1.3.1; Lemma 5.2.4, pp. 323–324 (PDF 343–344)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-slice-category</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span> 为范畴，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\">\\(I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\\)</span>，采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}\\)</span> 为其源函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>切片箭头带源靶标签 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle u,v,h\\rangle\">\\(\\langle u,v,h\\rangle\\)</span>，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u,v\">\\(u,v\\)</span> 时可简写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:u\\to v\">\\(h:u\\to v\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B/I\">\\(\\mathcal B/I\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}_I\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}_I\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u_!\">\\(u_!\\)</span> 的定义以下列构造为准。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>最后一组式中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u:I\\to J\">\\(u:I\\to J\\)</span> 是基箭头；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\">\\(a,b\\)</span> 是切片 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B/I\">\\(\\mathcal B/I\\)</span> 的对象。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cat}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cat}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Functor}\">\\(\\mathrm{Functor}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fib}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fib}\\)</span> 分别采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c9801f31ec8ac53f\" href=\"?note=c9801f31ec8ac53f\" title=\"16-df-fibration\">16-df-fibration</a> 的定义。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nO_I&amp;\\coloneqq\\{a\\in\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal B\\mid t(a)=I\\},\\\\\nM_I&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle a,b,h\\rangle\\mid a,b\\in O_I\n\\land h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal B}(\\operatorname{dom}a,\\operatorname{dom}b)\n\\land b h=a\\},\\\\\ns_I\\langle a,b,h\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq a,\n\\qquad t_I\\langle a,b,h\\rangle\\coloneqq b,\\\\\ne_I(a)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle a,a,\\operatorname{id}_{\\operatorname{dom}a}\\rangle,\\\\\nc_I(\\langle b,d,k\\rangle,\\langle a,b,h\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle a,d,kh\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal B/I&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O_I,M_I,s_I,t_I,e_I,c_I\\rangle,\\\\\n(\\operatorname{dom}_I)_0(a)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}a,\n\\qquad(\\operatorname{dom}_I)_1\\langle a,b,h\\rangle\\coloneqq h,\\\\\n\\operatorname{dom}_I&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(\\operatorname{dom}_I)_0,(\\operatorname{dom}_I)_1\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal B/I)&amp;,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Functor}(\\operatorname{dom}_I,\\mathcal B/I,\\mathcal B),\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Fib}(\\operatorname{dom}_I).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nO_I&amp;\\coloneqq\\{a\\in\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal B\\mid t(a)=I\\},\\\\\nM_I&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle a,b,h\\rangle\\mid a,b\\in O_I\n\\land h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal B}(\\operatorname{dom}a,\\operatorname{dom}b)\n\\land b h=a\\},\\\\\ns_I\\langle a,b,h\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq a,\n\\qquad t_I\\langle a,b,h\\rangle\\coloneqq b,\\\\\ne_I(a)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle a,a,\\operatorname{id}_{\\operatorname{dom}a}\\rangle,\\\\\nc_I(\\langle b,d,k\\rangle,\\langle a,b,h\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle a,d,kh\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal B/I&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O_I,M_I,s_I,t_I,e_I,c_I\\rangle,\\\\\n(\\operatorname{dom}_I)_0(a)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}a,\n\\qquad(\\operatorname{dom}_I)_1\\langle a,b,h\\rangle\\coloneqq h,\\\\\n\\operatorname{dom}_I&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(\\operatorname{dom}_I)_0,(\\operatorname{dom}_I)_1\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal B/I)&amp;,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Functor}(\\operatorname{dom}_I,\\mathcal B/I,\\mathcal B),\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Fib}(\\operatorname{dom}_I).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n(u_!)_0(a)&amp;\\coloneqq ua,\n\\qquad(u_!)_1\\langle a,b,h\\rangle\\coloneqq\\langle ua,ub,h\\rangle,\\\\\nu_!&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(u_!)_0,(u_!)_1\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Functor}(u_!,\\mathcal B/I,\\mathcal B/J)&amp;,\n\\qquad\\operatorname{dom}_J u_!=\\operatorname{dom}_I,\\\\\n(\\operatorname{id}_I)_!&amp;=\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal B/I},\n\\qquad(vu)_!=v_!u_!\\quad(v:J\\to K).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n(u_!)_0(a)&amp;\\coloneqq ua,\n\\qquad(u_!)_1\\langle a,b,h\\rangle\\coloneqq\\langle ua,ub,h\\rangle,\\\\\nu_!&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(u_!)_0,(u_!)_1\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Functor}(u_!,\\mathcal B/I,\\mathcal B/J)&amp;,\n\\qquad\\operatorname{dom}_J u_!=\\operatorname{dom}_I,\\\\\n(\\operatorname{id}_I)_!&amp;=\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal B/I},\n\\qquad(vu)_!=v_!u_!\\quad(v:J\\to K).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>源、靶标签保证同一基箭头出现在不同切片 Hom 中时仍有单值的切片源靶。范畴公理及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}_I,u_!\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}_I,u_!\\)</span> 的函子性由基范畴运算继承。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}_I\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}_I\\)</span> 是离散纤维化：沿 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:T\\to\\operatorname{dom}a\">\\(h:T\\to\\operatorname{dom}a\\)</span> 对对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 的提升是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle ah,a,h\\rangle\">\\(\\langle ah,a,h\\rangle\\)</span>，其他提升的对象与箭头由复合唯一确定。每个切片箭头均笛卡尔。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u_!\">\\(u_!\\)</span> 是后复合函子；它与沿 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 的拉回函子不同。其严格复合等式用于原书 Corollary 5.2.5 的分裂替代。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":